  (generated from the designer's 1600x1800 PNG; viewBox matches it 1:1).
  Plant only (the hills are the separate snippet swick-frag-ground). The three stems draw up from the base, leaves unfurl from their base,
  then each of the 60 buds pops out from where it meets its stalk, bottom to tip, before the plant sways.
  Animation classes come from snippets/swick-fragrance-art.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
